From: MatonOS audio team
Subject: [PATCH] build: allow bionic's no-op gettext compatibility

Bionic has no libintl. bionic-fill supplies a header-only
libintl fallback whose translation functions return their original strings.
Keep libintl for normal hosts, but do not require a separate library there.

--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -72,6 +72,6 @@
 pipewire_dep = dependency('libpipewire-0.3', version: '>= 1.0.2')
 mathlib = cc.find_library('m')
 threads_dep = dependency('threads')
-libintl_dep = dependency('intl')
+libintl_dep = dependency('intl', required: false)
 
 if build_modules
